\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces Methodological causal inference graphs mapping the specific institutional mechanisms modeled in the thesis. \textbf {Panel A} illustrates the Sharp Regression Discontinuity (RD), isolating council delay ($Y$) via the statutory 20\% protest petition threshold running variable ($R$). \textbf {Panel B} illustrates the Difference-in-Differences Event Study, isolating council dissent ($Y$) arising from the intersection of the discrete HOME Phase 1 policy time shock ($t$) and parcel eligibility ($E$).}}{24}{figure.caption.21}%
